WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.740
From the 1960s, Western seekers came
to India's ashrams in large numbers.

2
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:10.130
Soon, new ashrams opened in
Europe and America as well.

3
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:14.580
Yet in the ancient epics, an
ashram was a sage's forest hut,

4
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.480
far from any city.

5
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:21.810
So how did a forest hut become a place
that draws visitors from across the world?

6
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:26.410
In this mission, you'll trace how
ashrams changed in the 20th century.

7
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:31.220
Then you'll read what an ancient
text says about a place to meditate.

8
00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:36.250
Your mission: find out how ashrams changed
from forest huts to the places they

9
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.070
are today.
